# R2 with the MSIX package, when the candidate is a newer released version:
# RosmarOps accepts the update as a Microsoft Store update (invariant 8) and
# asks nothing about it. The command must finish with 0; any other question it
# may ask is answered as a person who only wants the report. journey.py checks
# that the console never showed the update question.
if-asked connect.console.prompt send \r
if-asked findings.console.prompt.accept send \r
# The questions about settings that live inside an app (Cursor, Grok Bot):
# Enter is «I don't know», the least controlled case.
if-asked decl.unknown send \r
if-asked usage.ask.prompt send n\r
if-asked console.press_enter send \r
expect-exit 0 timeout 600s
